  triage:description "Discovered during the Phase-AD phase-ending review's follow-up 'legacy message key' investigation. scripts/check-legacy-mailbox-paths.py maintains an ALLOWED_LEGACY_LITERALS allow-list referencing crates/atm-core/src/list.rs and crates/atm-core/src/read/mod.rs for a 'legacy:' prefix pattern, but both files no longer contain any 'legacy' text at all (confirmed via direct grep — zero hits). The stale allow-list entries reference code that has already been deleted; harmless (entries just never match) but inaccurate. Repo owner explicitly directed that this be pruned in the next cleanup pass; recorded here so it is tracked rather than forgotten." ;
